## Interface: 30300
## Title: Solar Tracker
## Notes: Solar Power display for the Sun Cleric: a notched bar, with a matching bar under it counting down Battle Cleric, gold to red as it runs out and flashing with the client spell-proc glow around it for the last four seconds. Dawn charges while Dawn is up, hides the client's orb, shows in combat or with a target. Ctrl + left-drag to move.
